{"4011720": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Pay at the pump", "steam_appid": 4011720, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of a gas station attendant working the graveyard shift. At first, it’s just another quiet night—until unsettling strangers begin to appear one after another. Their presence feels wrong. Their stories don’t add up. And with each encounter, your grip on reality slips further away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011720/extras/a6b607272e12e01ddc0f72b1aea399f8.poster.avif?t=1760364450\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011720/extras/a6b607272e12e01ddc0f72b1aea399f8.webm?t=1760364450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pay at the Pump</strong> is a psychological horror game inspired by the eerie atmosphere of early 2000s survival horror classics. Explore your station, serve suspicious customers, and uncover what lies beneath the surface of a seemingly ordinary night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔦 <strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric horror with retro-inspired 3D visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person exploration and interaction</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unsettling encounters with disturbing characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story-driven experience with a shocking twist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for fans of psychological and survival horror</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you survive the night—or discover the truth too late?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><